sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant UI as apps/app (UI)
  participant API as apps/app (API Edge)
  participant S as Supabase Auth
  participant RBAC as RBAC Guard
  participant W as Workspace Service
  participant OBS as Metrics/Logging

  U->>UI: Open /login
  UI->>U: Render login form
  U->>UI: Submit credentials
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>S: Authenticate
  alt Auth success
    S-->>API: Session + JWT
    API->>OBS: Log login_success
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (session)
    UI->>RBAC: Evaluate role/permissions
    RBAC-->>UI: Allow
    UI->>API: GET /api/workspaces (tenant context)
    API->>W: List workspaces for user
    W-->>API: Workspaces
    API->>OBS: Record latency + count
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (workspaces)
    UI->>U: Render workspace selector
  else Invalid credentials
    S-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
    API->>OBS: Log auth_failure + count
    API-->>UI: 401 (error)
    UI->>U: Show inline error + recovery CTA
  else Network / rate limit
    API-->>UI: 429/503 (retryable)
    UI->>OBS: Log retry_scheduled
    UI->>UI: Exponential backoff retry (bounded)
    UI->>U: Show "Retrying..." state
  end

  opt Workspace not accessible (RBAC)
    RBAC-->>UI: Deny (insufficient permission)
    UI->>OBS: Log rbac_denied
    UI->>U: Show access denied + contact admin
  end

